stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: Borrower initializes application
    Draft --> PendingReview: Application submitted
    PendingReview --> Funding: SOM Risk Model assigns grade & target approved
    PendingReview --> Rejected: Application fails validation rules

    state Funding {
        [*] --> CollectingCapital
        CollectingCapital --> CollectingCapital: Investor commits fractional capital
    }

    Funding --> Active: Target principal fully reached (100%)
    Funding --> Cancelled: Campaign duration expires unfulfilled

    state Active {
        [*] --> Scheduled
        Scheduled --> PaidInstallment: Monthly payment received
        PaidInstallment --> Scheduled: Remaining installments exist
        Scheduled --> Overdue: Payment missed past due date
        Overdue --> PaidInstallment: Overdue payment resolved
    }

    Active --> Repaid: All principal & interest balance settled
    Active --> Defaulted: Non-payment exceeds grace period threshold

    Repaid --> [*]
    Defaulted --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]